epx price\-lists prices delete PRICE_LIST_ID ID [flags]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Deletes the price ID of the price list PRICE_LIST_ID. Emporix answers an unknown ID as one that it deleted (204 No Content). PRICE_LIST_ID is the ID that \fBepx price\-lists list\fR shows. ID is the ID that \fBepx price\-lists prices list PRICE_LIST_ID\fR shows.
.PP
Deletes data, which cannot be undone. On a terminal, epx sends DELETE only once you type ID at its prompt. \fB\-\-yes\fR sends without asking (required without a terminal); \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR prints the request instead of sending it.
