.nf
epx price\-lists prices get PRICE_LIST_ID ID [flags]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Reads one price of a price list, in its currency. PRICE_LIST_ID is the ID that \fBepx price\-lists list\fR shows; an unknown one is not found. ID is the ID that \fBepx price\-lists prices list PRICE_LIST_ID\fR shows; an unknown one is not found. TIERS lists each tier value as sent; \fB\-o json\fR pairs it with the id of its tier in the price model MODEL (\fBepx price\-models get MODEL\fR; an empty MODEL is the default model).
